The Label · Size × Generation · node CL1 · CL1 · Every Claude name is TWO independent axes. The WORD (Haiku / Sonnet / Opus / Fable) = the size & capability TIER; the NUMBER (3 → 3.5 → 3.7 → 4 → 4.1 → 4.5 → 4.6 → 4.7 → 4.8) = the GENERATION — a full retrain, not a patch. So &lsquo;Sonnet 4.6&rsquo; reads as the Sonnet-SIZED model of the 4.6 GENERATION. The two advance on their own clocks — which is why Haiku still sits at 4.5 while Opus reached 4.8.

